{"id":"gaal","name":"Gaal","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:gaal"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Gaal","text":"Loathing, the son of Ebed, in whom the Shechemites “placed their confidence” when they became discontented with Abimelech. He headed the revolution, and led out the men of Shechem against Abimelech; but was defeated, and fled to his own home (Judg. 9:26-46). We hear no more of him after this battle."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1603","lemma":"גַּעַל","xlit":"Gaʻal","gloss":"Gaal, an Israelite","kjv":"Gaal","count":9,"share":0.56},{"strong":"H5971","lemma":"עַם","xlit":"ʻam","gloss":"a people","kjv":"folk, men, nation, people","count":8,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","xlit":"ʻîyr","gloss":"a city in the widest sense","kjv":"Ai, city, court, town","count":4,"share":0.25},{"strong":"H7218","lemma":"רֹאשׁ","xlit":"rôʼsh","gloss":"the head , whether literal or figurative","kjv":"band, beginning, captain, chapiter","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H251","lemma":"אָח","xlit":"ʼâch","gloss":"a brother )","kjv":"another, brother; kindred, like, other","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H6965","lemma":"קוּם","xlit":"qûwm","gloss":"to rise","kjv":"abide, accomplish, be clearer, confirm","count":3,"share":0.19}],"verses":["Judg.9.26","Judg.9.28","Judg.9.30","Judg.9.31","Judg.9.35","Judg.9.36","Judg.9.37","Judg.9.39","Judg.9.41","Judg.9.27","Judg.9.29","Judg.9.32","Judg.9.33","Judg.9.34","Judg.9.38","Judg.9.40"],"related":[{"id":"zebul","type":"cooccur","shared":14,"jaccard":0.875,"why":"14 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ebed","type":"cooccur","shared":10,"jaccard":0.588,"why":"10 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"conspiracy","type":"cooccur","shared":16,"jaccard":0.082,"why":"16 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"judge","type":"cooccur","shared":15,"jaccard":0.055,"why":"15 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"abner","type":"lexical","strong":"H5971","why":"both lead with עַם (H5971)"},{"id":"